      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": " - Hospital mangement app\n     -> Doctors\n     -> Patients                               M:N -> relationship\n\na patient might need to take consultation/appointment with many doctors\na doctor might be giving consulation to many patients ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
