      "index": "ap",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 76852559,
      "version": 605,
      "versionNonce": 693832175,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "TSE3Ysy68rQx40DzHBn97",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1779647110140,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "# Soft delete -> It means we dont actually delete the record, we just mark it as deleted\nwe donot actually remove it from a row, but just mark it somehow that this record is \ndeleted.\n\nHow to impl soft delete?\n\n - is_deleted column -> true false -> problem: we dont know when the record got deleted\n \n - deleted_at column -> null | timestamp -> if null it means record is not deleted else if it has a\ntimestamp then record is deleted\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "# Soft delete -> It means we dont actually delete the record, we just mark it as deleted\nwe donot actually remove it from a row, but just mark it somehow that this record is \ndeleted.\n\nHow to impl soft delete?\n\n - is_deleted column -> true false -> problem: we dont know when the record got deleted\n \n - deleted_at column -> null | timestamp -> if null it means record is not deleted else if it has a\ntimestamp then record is deleted\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
